 rs are free.Know Before You GoWalk-ins are welcome if there's space. To r
 eserve a space\, RSVP below.Plan to arrive at least 5 minutes before your
  tour to check in and get ready.If you prefer to save time at the lockers
 \, avoid bringing backpacks or large bags. A small handbag may be carried
  at your side.Where to find us\, where to park\, accessibility\, and muse
 um guidelinesWhen You ArriveCheck in with Guest Services staff on the fir
 st floor.Photography is welcome\, without flash or selfie stick.Please do
  not touch artwork.
