SUMMARY:Spring 2027 Internship Accelerator Program Call Out
DESCRIPTION:Interested in making a difference in the community while gain
 ing valuable professional experience? Seeking an internship for Spring 20
 27? Through the Internship Accelerator program\, The Walter Center will c
 onnect you with local nonprofit organizations to support your career and 
 mission-based work in Bloomington\, Indiana.If you're interested in apply
 ing to the Internship Accelerator program\, please attend a virtual infor
 mation session. We'll share:Program overview + timelineApplication detail
 s / tips for strong applications  There are three virtual session options
 . Choose the time that works best for you:September 1 at 5:00 pm  Septemb
 er 2 at 2:00 pm  September 3 at 12:00 pm    &#160\;This event is Momentum
  eligible.Accessibility accommodationsThe Walter Center strives to host i
 nclusive\, accessible events that enable all individuals to engage fully.
  To request an accommodation or for inquiries about accessibility\, pleas
 e use ourEvent Accommodations Request Formor contact ourevent accessibili
 ty coordinator.
