 nclusive\, accessible events that enable all individuals to engage fully.
  To request an accommodation or for inquiries about accessibility\, pleas
 e use ourEvent Accommodations Request Formor contact ourevent accessibili
 ty coordinator.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span data-contrast="none">Interested in 
 making a difference in the community while gaining valuable professional 
 experience? Seeking an internship for Spring 2027? Through the Internship
  Accelerator program\, The Walter Center will connect you with local nonp
 rofit organizations to support your career and mission-based work in Bloo
 mington\, Indiana.</span></p><p><span data-contrast="none">If you're inte
 rested in applying to the Internship Accelerator program\, please attend 
 a virtual information session. We'll share:</span></p><ul><li><span data-
 contrast="none">Program overview + timeline</span></li><li><span data-con
 trast="none">Application details / tips for strong applications</span></l
 i></ul><p>  There are three virtual session options. Choose the time that
  works best for you:</p><ul><li>September 1 at 5:00 pm  </li><li>Septembe
 r 2 at 2:00 pm  </li><li>September 3 at 12:00 pm  </li></ul><p>  &#160\;<
 /p><p><span data-contrast="auto">This event is Momentum eligible.</span><
 /p><p aria-level="3"><strong><span data-contrast="auto">Accessibility acc
 ommodations</span></strong></p><p><span data-contrast="auto">The Walter C
