SUMMARY:Eskenazi – Grad School Application Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Graduate school application season is approaching! Are you co
 nsidering an advanced degree in art\, architecture\, design\, or a relate
 d field—but not sure how to prepare a strong application? This Grad Sch
 ool Application Workshop is designed to help Eskenazi students understand
  the application process\, organize materials\, and present creative and 
 academic experiences effectively. You'll learn how to:Research graduate p
 rograms and evaluate which ones align with your goalsBuild an application
  timeline and keep track of important deadlinesPrepare a focused statemen
 t of purpose or personal statementStrengthen your résumé or CV for grad
 uate admissionsRequest strong letters of recommendation and communicate w
 ith potential recommendersAvoid common application mistakes and submit ma
 terials with confidenceWho Should Attend:Eskenazi School of Art\, Archite
 cture + Design students from any major who are considering graduate schoo
 l and want guidance developing a thoughtful\, competitive application.  T
 his event is Momentum eligible.
