 </span></i><span data-contrast="none">is one of the first English-languag
 e monographs on French avant-garde architect Claude Parent and the first 
 comprehensive study of his experimental interior installations from the 1
 970s. He recently edited</span><i><span data-contrast="none">Interior Exp
 eriments</span></i><span data-contrast="none">\, a special triple-issue o
 f</span><i><span data-contrast="none">Interiors: Design/Architecture/Cult
 ure</span></i><span data-contrast="none">\, where he has served as Editor
